su name example meta be map def
su name required ob ve text "PYA_MIND_TOOL" "OLLAMA_HOST" ya
prah

su name coding tools be map def
su name command be command ob text input to name text out can
su name repair be repair ob text input to name map outcome can
prah

ob text "mkdir -p examples/out && cat <<'JS' > examples/out/gptoss-repair-autonomous.js
console.log(41);
JS" be command do

exists su name helper system ob text "You are a coding assistant. Available tools are command(ob text input -> to name text out) and repair(ob text input -> to name map outcome). First inspect the file with command. Then fix it using repair with unified diff patch text. Then verify with command. Return only the final stdout text." ya
exists su name helper be mind as name "gpt-oss:latest" fromtext name helper system ya

ob text quoted.text.Target file: examples/out/gptoss-repair-autonomous.js
Goal: running `node examples/out/gptoss-repair-autonomous.js` must print 42.
Rules:
- Use command to inspect current file content.
- Use repair to apply a unified diff patch.
- Use command again to verify result.
- Reply with only the verified stdout text..text.quoted for name helper to name text output with name coding tools be write do
ob name output be write do
